  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A wide marker painting of a crowd of rounded cartoon heads in orange, olive, tan and blue with white visor shapes and black outlines on wood.",
    "description": "A landscape format marker painting on wood with the grain showing through the colour. Overlapping rounded heads and bodies pack the panel: bulbous forms in orange, rust, olive, mustard, sky blue and pink, each with a white visor or window shape, small dots for eyes, and curled white horns or tabs. A pink head with an open mouth and a white speech balloon sits at centre, a blue head with a hat shape at upper right, and a pale blue face with large eyes at lower left. Thick black outlines, flat marker fills.",
    "impression": "An earthier crowd than the others, in autumn colours on bare wood, like a crowd of acorns and gourds. The white visors make them look like helmets or screens, so the crowd could be a stadium of spectators. Warm and slightly muffled, a crowd at a distance.",
